[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.347, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[J\u001b[4;20H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m                                                           \u001b[5;20H"]
[0.000, "o", "  Men at some time are masters of their fates:             \u001b[6;20H  The fault, dear Brutus, is not in our stars,             \u001b[7;20H"]
[0.000, "o", "  But in ourselves, that we are underlings.                \u001b[8;20H"]
[0.000, "o", "                                                           \u001b[9;20H"]
[0.000, "o", "  -- Cassius to Brutus in 'Julius Caesar', Act I, Scene 2  \u001b[10;20H                                                           \r\u001b[12d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.143, "o", "\u001b[1;11r\u001b[11;1H\u001b[5S\u001b[1;30r\u001b[1;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m Exits:  S                                                       \u001b[1;79H"]
[0.000, "o", "      Sorcerer's Den  \u001b[7;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou are nine months pregnant, and the contractions have already begun. Trapped in a castle with more\u001b[8;1Henemies than friends, and Queen in name but not in influence, you fear for the future of your child.\u001b[9;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "But your spells have finally worked, and now your crystal ball shows what fate awaits him. If you\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "act with speed and determination, and if you are willing to do what is necessary, you may still have\u001b[11;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "time to influence your son's destiny before the waters break.\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mFate\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mAn Interactive Fiction by Victor Gijsbers\r\u001b[16dRelease 1 / Serial number 070329 / Inform 7 build 4K41 (I6/v6.31 lib 6/11N)\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "This work is licensed under the GNU Public License, version 2 or later.\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "Type HELP for more information, or HINTS if you get stuck.\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mSorcerer's Den\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThe servants know it is death to enter your den, your sanctuary from public life. Two braziers cast\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "warmth and just enough mellow light to see the tapestries that line three of the four walls. A\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "small, intricately decorated cabinet huddles in the far corner, while a heavy curtain obscures the\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "doorway to the south. Faint wisps of magic linger in the air.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "A glowing crystal ball, placed carefully in the middle of a large table, beckons you to examine the\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "future of your unborn child. Two paths lie open to you: you can struggle to change it, or simply\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "WAIT here, in your den, for his fate to arrive.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
