[0.091, "o", "\u001b[C"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mb\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ma\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.093, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[13M\u001b[18d\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou gaze into the crystal ball. At first, you see only writhing lines of black and purple, but then,\u001b[19;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "slowly, an image coalesces out of the chaos.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "Strangely enough, the visions show not your son, but yourself, still pregnant. You are just getting\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "into your bed... then... you scream! Your face twists in pain, your eyes bulge, and then you fall\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "backwards, evidently dead.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "After that the vision vanishes from the ball.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
