[0.000, "o", "\u001b[4M\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mScenes of heroism and courtly love are depicted in vivid colours. These tapestries were among the\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "few possessions you could take with you from your parents' castle.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ms\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mo\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
