[0.094, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[12M\u001b[1;10H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mN E W\u001b[1;85H"]
[0.000, "o", "Parlour       \r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou open the heavy curtain, pulling it close again behind you.\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mParlour\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThe parlour, which is the central room of your three-room apartment, is less your own than you'd\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "like: one of Prince Harold's knights, Sir Charles, has installed himself on the leather couch. The\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "walls are adorned by three paintings and a huge mirror, none of them to your taste. Luckily, there\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "are three routes of escape: your den lies to the north, your bedroom to the east, and the rest of\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "the castle can be reached by the staircase to the west.\r\u001b[28dYou can see a small table (on which is a teddy bear) and a goblet (in which is some wine) here.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.412, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mq\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
